 "text": "Hi, how's your day been so far? Kids listen to a lot of the same things adults do, but with shorter episodes and fewer swears. There are kid friendly science and history podcasts, as well as picture stories. Most of them are very safe. Read them together first so you know what's in them. For younger kids, it's best with you around. Older kids can listen together, as long as it's supervised. Kids also love making their own favourites. Recording a story with parent or finding a picture book podcast that tells the story is a great idea.",
